  1934	// checkoutBlockers are the blockers of the sealed checkout that hold there. Two kinds do not,
  1935	// because they concern evidence that is not part of the sealed subject and that a checkout of
  1936	// the sealed commit cannot hold: the delivery integrity index (derived, not checked out) and the
  1937	// sealed review bundles of the children of a roadmap or milestone. The children are reviewed and
  1938	// committed before the roadmap bundle is sealed, but the subject's head is the last commit that
  1939	// changed a subject path, which is older than their records; the bundle sealed at the real head
  1940	// already judged them, and closing the scope judges them again (spec
  1941	// pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence).
  1942	func checkoutBlockers(blockers []string) []string {
